  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling Merit-Based Recruitment in Public Administration in Montenegro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen the merit-based recruitment practices in Montenegros public administration to enhance the competence, efficiency, and independence of the civil service. By addressing the challenges posed by recent amendments to the Law on civil servants and state employees, the project will contribute to broader CSSF Programme outcomes, specifically to more effective, transparent, and accountable institutions. Through capacity-building, recruitment process improvements, and foste</narrative>
  </description>
