    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2025-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2025-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Two sets of recommendations developed</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Set of working procedures developed and in active use ensuring gender equality and inclusivity considerations</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">This indicator is related to a set of methodologies and working procedures that Administrative Inspection currently does not: Methodology of the yearly supervision planning, Reporting Methodology, Inspection Supervision Detailed Procedures, Risk Assessment Methodology</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2023">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Methodologies do not exist</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2024-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2024-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Draft methodologies exist</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developed draft methodologies</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2025-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2025-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">All methodologies adopted by the Ministry and in active use</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="2">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Knowledge and capacities of the targeted staff, including gender equality related competencies, improved by 40% (average increase)</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator is related to the knowledge of the inspectors in dealing with the developed methodologies which are the highest standard of the inspection supervision. This indicator will be achieved through a range of induction workshops in the use of contemporary practices in inspection supervision (such as risk assessment), as well as training in areas such as Ethics and Anti-Corruption, Internal and External Communication, Gender Equality, etc.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="0" year="2023"></baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2024-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2024-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="0"></target>
     <actual value="5"></actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2025-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2025-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="40"></target>
    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Number of measures to strengthen accountability (including social accountability), prevent and mitigate corruption risks, and integrate anti-corruption in the management of public funds, service delivery and other sectors at national level</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">This indicator is related to the existence of two documents. First one is the Risk assessment methodology which is one of the tools used by majority of developed inspection systems and it serves to allow inspectors to plan their inspection based on the identified risk of irregularities. Montenegrin Administrative inspection was not using that methodology and the inspection planning was based on some other, not evidence-based factor. In addition, project envisages improvement of the Law on Administrative Inspection as the current one is not adequately defining all of the elements of the inspection supervision. In addition, the law needs to be aligned with the Law on Inspection Supervision.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="0" year="2023"></baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2024-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2024-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="0"></target>
     <actual value="0"></actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2025-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2025-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="2"></target>
    </period>
   </indicator>
